## E. Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Likely cause / fix |
|---|---|
| Login page loads but every request fails (console: CORS / mixed content / `:8001` refused) | The frontend was built without the `VITE_*` values, or with the wrong ones. Set them to `https://your-domain/api` and **rebuild** the frontend |
| `404` on `/api/...` reaching FastAPI as `/api/...` | `proxy_pass` is missing its trailing slash. Use `http://127.0.0.1:8001/;` |
| `404` on refresh of `/dashboard` | The SPA fallback is missing. Use `try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;` |
| CORS error with correct URLs | `CORS_ORIGINS` doesn't include the exact origin (scheme + host, no trailing slash) |
| `413 Request Entity Too Large` on import/upload | Raise `client_max_body_size` in nginx |
| `Found an encrypted .env value (enc:...) but no decryption key` | `.secrets.key` is missing or empty, or `ENV_SECRETS_KEY_FILE` points to the wrong place |
| `InvalidToken` when decrypting | The value was encrypted with a different key (for example the dev key). Re-encrypt with the production key |
| Docker: `Waiting for the database...` then alembic `connection refused` | Postgres isn't reachable from the container. Check B.3 (`listen_addresses`, `pg_hba.conf`, `host.docker.internal`) |
| `password authentication failed` | Wrong DB credentials in `DATABASE_URL`, or the `pg_hba.conf` method doesn't match |
| `relation "..." does not exist` | Migrations didn't run. Run `alembic upgrade head` (A.5) or check the backend logs (B.5) |
| Uploaded evidence missing after redeploy | `api/uploads` wasn't kept (non-Docker: don't delete the folder; Docker: keep the `./api/uploads` bind mount) |
| `npm run build` fails with a Vite/Node error | Node is too old. Install Node 22 (A.1) |
| `502 Bad Gateway` from nginx | The backend is down. Check `journalctl -u saypy-api -e` or `docker compose ... logs backend` |

