## F. Pre-go-live checklist

- [ ] Strong, unique `JWT_SECRET_KEY`, DB password and `SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD` (not the dev ones)
- [ ] New `.secrets.key` for production, stored safely, `chmod 600`
- [ ] `CORS_ORIGINS` set to the real domain (not `*`)
- [ ] Frontend built with `VITE_*` pointing at `https://your-domain/api`
- [ ] HTTPS working, HTTP redirects to HTTPS, certbot renewal tested
